  "body": "We are planning to implement and ship the keepalive flag. At [the intent-to-ship thread](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/forum/m/#!topic/blink-dev/8vqcABTnDF4), some people want to  restrict the number of requests at a time, as well as the total number of inflight bytes. Do you think it's reasonable?\r\n\r\n@yoavweiss @annevk @igrigorik ",
